# Force LF line endings on text source files. Biome (apps/desktop/biome.json)
# pins `lineEnding: "lf"`, so a CRLF-checked-out file fails `biome format`
# even on a clean tree. This file makes git store + check out matching paths
# with LF on every platform, eliminating the Windows CRLF drift.
#
# Apply broadly to all common text formats. Binary assets stay binary. See
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes for the matcher syntax.

*               text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary exceptions — never let `text=auto` decide on these.
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.icns          binary
*.webp          binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
*.ttf           binary
*.otf           binary
*.eot           binary
*.mp4           binary
*.webm          binary
*.zip           binary
*.gz            binary
*.tgz           binary
*.7z            binary
*.exe           binary
*.dll           binary
*.dmg           binary
*.snap          binary
*.AppImage      binary
*.deb           binary
*.rpm           binary
